#* Island: after `seedDrained` with `keepLanded` (sovereign-kernel.ts); the island runtime disables TW5 `story` (tw5-host-bridge.ts).
#* lar-story binds doors only and reads no hash; tm-home in both modules calls the door.
#* House plugin shadow `tiddlers/default-tiddlers.tid`: `[all[tiddlers]tag[$:/tags/lares/Landing]] ~[[GettingStarted]]`. New canon `bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/welcome.mem` tagged Landing.
# ''Pane'' — `index.html` `#projection-wiki` beside the summon button; `src/pane-label.ts`, wired in `main.ts`; `page-mirror.ts` sets `data-lar-mirror-why`, plus a read-only `larMirrorReading` for the weld.

