<<~ ahu slot=`#/forks-decided`>>

!! Forks decided (moʻolelo, overrulable)
* ''Stock class by namespace.'' A packed plugin titled under `$:/themes/tiddlywiki/`, `$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/` or `$:/languages/` reads `stock` and folds into no epoch. Why: it rides the core's TW5 revision, so a TW5 bump moves the engine CID beside it. The alternative, a per-title list, enumerates.
* ''Gate by capability, not CID.'' Stock themes pass because they carry no JavaScript module, not because their CID matches. This plumbs nothing new through `mirrorInputs`, and a third-party theme carrying a module now waits on the seal. The gate also refuses a theme carrying a saver; before, any non-`plugin` type slipped through.
* ''Palette as a typed slot.'' The dictionary rides `#/palette` (title `…/gruvbox-dark#/palette`). A dictionary-typed carrier root would have stopped projecting to disk (`isCarrierType`).
* ''The wiki owns its landing by tag.'' No carrier can take the title `$:/DefaultTiddlers`, so a house shadow reads `$:/tags/lares/Landing` records from the wiki's own bags and falls back to GettingStarted. A wiki that authors its own `$:/DefaultTiddlers` overrides the shadow.
* ''The island writes its first story as a hand.'' After `seedDrained`, through the bridge, keeping any landed personal StoryList. This adds one StoryList save per wiki on first boot, the same class of write as every navigation; e2e stays unproven locally.
* ''W2–W4 stay as floor vectors.'' M1–M5 read the mirror instead of rewriting them.
* ''M5 fails on a refused write.'' A faceless floor wiki whose port refuses writes reads red, never a gap.
* ''Row 17 closes only its default-story half.'' The StartupAction re-run and the `.mem` registration stay owed.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/owed`>>

!! Owed
* ''The bake and the floor cut.'' CI's held-out weld reads M2/M3 as declared gaps until both land:
** controller bake: genesis CAS blobs for the four rows;
** floor cut: welcome + palette slot reach a browser through `floor-lares`/`floor-lararium`.
* G3 doors (modal, notify, clipboard, download, route), M4 goldens 1–13 at full against stock, and D6 SSR all stay owed.
* The mirror's page background. `body.tc-body` never matches inside the shadow root, so the ground shows the host page beneath the gruvbox frames.
* The e2e/weld prove the first-boot StoryList hand and M5 only in CI.

